On Tue, 13 Mar 2006, ilya2@rcn.com wrote:

> I understand that in order to win the game you are supposed to complete
> a quest, which involves acquiring a "quest artifact" -- Eyes of the
> Overworld, in my case. My question is -- what else does the quest
> entail? Do you get some hint from your god as to how to go about it?

Not really. Your Quest Leader has some hints for you (that you will face
earth elementals and other E). To reach your goal, go down from the level
where you received the Quest, after the Grand Master has admitted you.
When you have killed Master Kaen, you will find another unique item which
you should recover.

